  "stem": "<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861841-114651791852237200-wRCPENZYe7_2Homr0ISr213mQaaskpJnYM-9XZSE4M7PMP0fjRAOYNvZ5XSwKhyv\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">常温下，反应物</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ff4489d9b83072184c0e1d6b09be50ca.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ea1e8babee63bfc889ae5a34632284bc.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在溶液中发生如下平行</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">—</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">连续反应：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅰ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">．</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/f3a0babe3a09fe3464eaa7a26bd2863e.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'\" qml-space-size=\"4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>Ⅱ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">．</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/3b97c21aaab65c3e2ad4d40150c59308.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">初始浓度</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/20d56ca6b3aec2363374543974ac09a3.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a5688dfa97cd402d9e2355fcae6e22c9.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ca66a268d6f46e0e9d5d9151b785be60.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/1f0b669ef4514f24ee09adeff7f41238.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/61588617d22abd00af4ca489bb3a8787.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的浓度</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ca71ef61c50a9f92306bb012a5cf96aa.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">随时间</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/470c0de8a9c768fbeb452139695e4a01.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的变化曲线如图。下列说法错误的是</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><img  height=\"139\" src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/editorImg/2026/9/21/7aa36452-fe43-48a4-a5e8-bca6f74b9004.png\" width=\"213\" /></p><div class=\" qml-og\"><table class=\"qml-og\" style=\"width:100%\"><tr><td>A.&nbsp;<span class=\"qml-op\"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/258209cd3c3fab59d466fd3d30567032.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">内，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ab6c0ca56f3a43744e4e9112c4f5ffdb.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></span></td></tr><tr><td>B.&nbsp;<span class=\"qml-op\"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b5fe1d81dab3a2273e201ab143110c7f.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">内，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ca66a268d6f46e0e9d5d9151b785be60.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的曲线有交点</span></span></td></tr><tr><td>C.&nbsp;<span class=\"qml-op\"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/fc2a39beea5adf5d07aea0424ca7a64f.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">点时，反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅰ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/061665f43ac493fdfa75913747c06a0b.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">等于反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅱ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/061665f43ac493fdfa75913747c06a0b.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\">D.&nbsp;<span class=\"qml-op\"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/54d76c38444d0bce1975eb7d3c75e957.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">不变时，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/f7cd2e42538c6286037a8333b38a88b2.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></span></td></tr></table></div></div>",
  "answer": "<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class=\"qml-answer\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861841-114651791852237200-wRCPENZYe7_2Homr0ISr213mQaaskpJnYM-9XZSE4M7PMP0fjRAOYNvZ5XSwKhyv\"><span class=\"qml-an-sq\"><span class=\"qml-an qml-isop \">C</span></span></div>",
  "explanation": "<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class=\"qml-explanation\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861841-114651791852237200-wRCPENZYe7_2Homr0ISr213mQaaskpJnYM-9XZSE4M7PMP0fjRAOYNvZ5XSwKhyv\"><div class=\"qml-seg\" seg-name=\"分析\">【分析】<p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已知反应：</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅰ.&nbsp;</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/9eca462324254b2eed1fc98064256418.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅱ.&nbsp;</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/0269f9bcaedc405268a9059093b38edb.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。初始浓度：</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/177a5f3f7911348719915ab1426876f3.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/bffd1cab72c8de810e481bde2cd1ee09.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。观察图像，在</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/0729625b97f22d00f3f82b5845c8a823.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时，各物质浓度分别为：</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/76ab286e65cc35b6fe44d0debc985cb7.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/3189c754813b8aaf2c314dec20dbb844.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/0c5b0fd9f12bbbeedea77302a6f30984.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。根据反应方程式，我们可以找出各物质的变化量关系：反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅰ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中，每生成</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/d6c9d64b5f633786cb963d54404e32b1.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a2efbc199c130218fd28badb1419d69d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，消耗</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/9ce72bb2418a198c496c2cccf2fc8839.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/12a08d078f783684eb142f140d6d2747.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅱ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中，每生成</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/05ae47a0de03c56afcfb150325f6dc68.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a2efbc199c130218fd28badb1419d69d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，消耗</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/9ce72bb2418a198c496c2cccf2fc8839.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/d6c9d64b5f633786cb963d54404e32b1.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。设反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅰ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">生成</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">D</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的浓度为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/81dea63b8ce3e51adf66cf7b9982a248.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅱ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">生成的</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">D</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的浓度为</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/d053b14c8588eee2acbbe44fc37a6886.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。则体系中</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">D</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的总浓度</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/45ea36996f4bdcd56e7cef21bc2ddf11.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。体系中</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">E</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的浓度</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/0768d137cdb82e88946eec3a1fd4b28b.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。故反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅱ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">生成的</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">D</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的浓度</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ed27df87b1739f030e8cb15c5786b3f5.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅰ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">生成的</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">D</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的浓度</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b81306493c7268168457df75602f4da6.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。同时反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅰ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">生成的</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的浓度为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/16f3f26647e6a0ec13b80f2f5e56a652.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅱ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">消耗了部分</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">来生成</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">E</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，消耗</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的浓度等于生成的</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">E</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的浓度，即</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/6c80391e0ef8174b5e66d4a14999909f.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，据此解答；</span></p></div><div class=\"qml-seg\" seg-name=\"详解\">【详解】<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">．由上述分析可知，反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅰ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中消耗的</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">B</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的浓度等于反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅰ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">生成的</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">D</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的浓度，即</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/6e015f341715e37c239aba6d2c73dc0c.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。因此</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a3783989277bf6f7749e25f5f9cf124c.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">内，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">B</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的平均反应速率为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/75bd45aa3f60b4ed444b9efeda85acac.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">正确；</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">B</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">．</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅰ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅱ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中均被消耗。</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/0729625b97f22d00f3f82b5845c8a823.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的总消耗量</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"> = </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅰ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">消耗的</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A + </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅱ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">消耗的</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A =&nbsp;</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/6135408e48edd4ea35b39d27380cf305.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。此时</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的剩余浓度</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/abed8fa1601dacddf2bcc5110beed874.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。而此时</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的浓度</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/3189c754813b8aaf2c314dec20dbb844.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。可见在</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/0729625b97f22d00f3f82b5845c8a823.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/f4d8c924d9e59e1d7896b95586f8f2b6.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。在反应初始阶段，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/177a5f3f7911348719915ab1426876f3.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/bb610a894662776f2f19ece781c20155.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，即</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ec728ab713a0b0b13bfefaac7b0ac474.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。随着反应进行，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的浓度不断减小，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的浓度先增大后减小，既然初始时</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ec728ab713a0b0b13bfefaac7b0ac474.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，而在</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/0729625b97f22d00f3f82b5845c8a823.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/f4d8c924d9e59e1d7896b95586f8f2b6.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，且两者的浓度变化是连续的，那么在此时间段内，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"> C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的浓度曲线必然存在一个交点，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">B</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">正确；</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">．</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">a</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">点对应的时间为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/0729625b97f22d00f3f82b5845c8a823.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">之前，此时</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的浓度达到最大值。当</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的浓度达到最大时</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的生成速率等于其消耗速率。</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的生成来自反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅰ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的消耗来自反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅱ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。即</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/87a7d064ab6bc5b12415d8f4d4b66471.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，对应到反应速率上，即：反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅰ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">生成</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的速率</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"> = </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅱ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">消耗</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的速率。由于反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅰ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的生成速率即为反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅰ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的正反应速率</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/4017e88df4f12a7f94c4fb1b50d05327.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，而反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅱ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">消耗</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的速率是反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅱ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的正反应速率</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/5221d8ce64cbf49412587ec22beb2d25.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">减去反应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅱ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的逆反应生成</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的速率</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/092089c1b294edcc18598ba77f425d01.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。严格来说，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的净变化速率为</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时：</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/7534483f573b26f4b08052ce0a9c7436.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，即</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b48516b9f7798ed794d124977105c936.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。选项中仅说</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">a</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">点时</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/4017e88df4f12a7f94c4fb1b50d05327.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">等于</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/5221d8ce64cbf49412587ec22beb2d25.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，这只有在</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/7d7e523e7c2bf966afa16a5f4e986c70.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时才成立，但题目并未给出此条件，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">错误；</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">D</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">．当体系中某物质的浓度不再改变时，说明整个反应体系达到了化学平衡状态。在平衡状态下，对于任意一种物质，其生成速率等于消耗速率。因此当</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/2a3f7964b9e06e71d2b4837a5407461c.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">不变时，体系处于平衡状态，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的生成速率必然等于</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的消耗速率，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">D</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">正确；</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">故选</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p></div></div>",
